{"seq":4,"slug":"ast-design","title":"抽象语法树设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing/ast-design","wordCount":1487,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"抽象语法树设计\">抽象语法树设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>抽象语法树（Abstract Syntax Tree, AST）是源代码的树形结构化表示。与具体语法树（CST/解析树）不同，AST 省略了语法上必要但语义上无关的元素——括号、分号、逗号等标点符号被丢弃，只保留程序的语义骨架。</p>\n<p>AST 是编译器前端和后端之间的核心接口。语法分析器生成 AST，语义分析器在 AST 上进行类型检查和名字解析，代码生成器从 AST 出发生成中间表示或目标代码。AST 的设计质量直接影响后续所有阶段的实现复杂度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Token 流]&#10;    B --&gt; C[CST/解析树]&#10;    C --&gt; D[AST]&#10;    D --&gt; E[语义分析]&#10;    E --&gt; F[IR 生成]&#10;    D --&gt; G[代码格式化]&#10;    D --&gt; H[IDE 功能]\">graph LR\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Token 流]\n    B --&gt; C[CST/解析树]\n    C --&gt; D[AST]\n    D --&gt; E[语义分析]\n    E --&gt; F[IR 生成]\n    D --&gt; G[代码格式化]\n    D --&gt; H[IDE 功能]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>具体语法树 CST</th>\n<th>抽象语法树 AST</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保留标点</td>\n<td>是（括号、分号等）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留空白</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点数量</td>\n<td>多</td>\n<td>少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息忠实度</td>\n<td>完全忠于源码</td>\n<td>忠于语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>代码格式化、精确重写</td>\n<td>编译、分析、转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建方式</td>\n<td>解析器直接产出</td>\n<td>解析器构建或 CST 转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ast-节点类型设计\">AST 节点类型设计</h2><p>AST 的核心是节点类型系统。每种语法结构对应一种节点类型，节点之间的父子关系反映了程序的层次结构。</p>\n<p>常见的 AST 节点类型体系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Program = {&#10;  type: &#39;Program&#39;;&#10;  body: Statement[];&#10;};&#10;&#10;type Statement =&#10;  | ExpressionStatement&#10;  | IfStatement&#10;  | WhileStatement&#10;  | ReturnStatement&#10;  | FunctionDeclaration&#10;  | VariableDeclaration&#10;  | BlockStatement;&#10;&#10;type Expression =&#10;  | BinaryExpression&#10;  | UnaryExpression&#10;  | CallExpression&#10;  | MemberExpression&#10;  | Identifier&#10;  | NumericLiteral&#10;  | StringLiteral&#10;  | AssignmentExpression;&#10;&#10;type BinaryExpression = {&#10;  type: &#39;BinaryExpression&#39;;&#10;  operator: &#39;+&#39; | &#39;-&#39; | &#39;*&#39; | &#39;/&#39; | &#39;==&#39; | &#39;!=&#39;;&#10;  left: Expression;&#10;  right: Expression;&#10;};&#10;&#10;type IfStatement = {&#10;  type: &#39;IfStatement&#39;;&#10;  test: Expression;&#10;  consequent: BlockStatement;&#10;  alternate: BlockStatement | IfStatement | null;&#10;};&#10;&#10;type FunctionDeclaration = {&#10;  type: &#39;FunctionDeclaration&#39;;&#10;  name: Identifier;&#10;  params: Identifier[];&#10;  returnType: TypeAnnotation | null;&#10;  body: BlockStatement;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Program</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Program'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Statement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Statement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExpressionStatement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IfStatement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WhileStatement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReturnStatement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FunctionDeclaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VariableDeclaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BlockStatement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Expression</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BinaryExpression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UnaryExpression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CallExpression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemberExpression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Identifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NumericLiteral</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StringLiteral</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AssignmentExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BinaryExpression</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BinaryExpression'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  operator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '+'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '-'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '*'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '=='</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '!='</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Expression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Expression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IfStatement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'IfStatement'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Expression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  consequent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BlockStatement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alternate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BlockStatement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IfStatement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FunctionDeclaration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FunctionDeclaration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Identifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Identifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  returnType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TypeAnnotation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BlockStatement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>节点类型设计的几个关键原则：</p>\n<p><strong>表达式与语句分离</strong>。表达式（Expression）产生值，语句（Statement）执行动作。在 AST 中区分二者有助于类型检查——类型系统只需要处理表达式节点。</p>\n<p><strong>使用联合类型（Tagged Union）</strong>。每个节点有一个 <code>type</code> 字段作为判别标签。这使得 AST 遍历可以通过 <code>switch(node.type)</code> 实现类型安全的分派。</p>\n<p><strong>可选字段用 null/undefined</strong>。例如 <code>IfStatement.alternate</code> 可以是 <code>null</code>（没有 else 分支）。这比为每种组合创建不同的节点类型更简洁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位置信息与源码映射\">位置信息与源码映射</h2><p>AST 节点需要携带源码位置信息，用于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>编译错误和警告的精确定位</li>\n<li>IDE 的跳转和高亮功能</li>\n<li>Source Map 生成（用于调试转译后的代码）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>位置信息通常包含起始和结束位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type SourceLocation = {&#10;  start: Position;&#10;  end: Position;&#10;  source?: string;&#10;};&#10;&#10;type Position = {&#10;  line: number;&#10;  column: number;&#10;  offset: number;&#10;};&#10;&#10;type BaseNode = {&#10;  type: string;&#10;  loc: SourceLocation;&#10;  range?: [number, number];&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SourceLocation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  column</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  offset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BaseNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  loc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SourceLocation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  range</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>ESTree 规范</strong>是 JavaScript AST 的事实标准。Babel、ESLint、Prettier 等工具都遵循 ESTree，这使得它们可以共享 AST。ESTree 定义了每种 JS 语法结构的精确节点类型和字段。</p>\n<p><strong>Span/Range 表示法</strong>比行列号更适合内部处理。span 是源码中的字节偏移范围 <code>[start, end)</code>。行列号需要时可以从 span 和源码文本反算，避免在每个节点上存储冗余信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"访问者模式与-ast-遍历\">访问者模式与 AST 遍历</h2><p>AST 的遍历和变换是编译器最频繁的操作。 <strong>访问者模式</strong>（Visitor Pattern）是实现 AST 遍历的标准设计模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Visitor = {&#10;  visitBinaryExpression?: (node: BinaryExpression) =&gt; void;&#10;  visitIfStatement?: (node: IfStatement) =&gt; void;&#10;  visitIdentifier?: (node: Identifier) =&gt; void;&#10;  // ... 每种节点类型一个方法&#10;};&#10;&#10;function traverse(node: ASTNode, visitor: Visitor): void {&#10;  const method = visitor[`visit${node.type}`];&#10;  if (method) method(node);&#10;&#10;  for (const child of getChildren(node)) {&#10;    traverse(child, visitor);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Visitor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  visitBinaryExpression</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BinaryExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  visitIfStatement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IfStatement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  visitIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Identifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // ... 每种节点类型一个方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> traverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">visitor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Visitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> visitor[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`visit${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (method) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getChildren</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    traverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(child, visitor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>访问者模式有两个变体：</p>\n<p><strong>前序遍历</strong>（Pre-order）：先访问当前节点，再递归访问子节点。适用于收集信息、构建符号表。</p>\n<p><strong>后序遍历</strong>（Post-order）：先递归访问子节点，再访问当前节点。适用于类型推导（子表达式的类型决定父表达式的类型）。</p>\n<p>Babel 的插件系统就是基于访问者模式构建的。每个 Babel 插件定义一组 visitor 方法，可以在遍历过程中修改 AST 节点。这使得代码转换的编写变得模块化——每个插件只关注自己负责的语法结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ast-变换与不可变性\">AST 变换与不可变性</h2><p>AST 变换是编译器和代码工具的核心操作。两种主要策略是<strong>就地修改</strong>（In-Place Mutation）和<strong>不可变变换</strong>（Immutable Transformation）。</p>\n<p><strong>就地修改</strong>直接修改 AST 节点的属性。优点是简单高效，缺点是修改可能影响其他引用同一节点的代码。</p>\n<p><strong>不可变变换</strong>创建新节点代替旧节点。每次变换产生一棵新的 AST（共享未修改的子树）。这使得变换可以安全地组合，不会产生意外的副作用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function constantFold(node: Expression): Expression {&#10;  if (node.type !== &#39;BinaryExpression&#39;) return node;&#10;&#10;  const left = constantFold(node.left);&#10;  const right = constantFold(node.right);&#10;&#10;  if (left.type === &#39;NumericLiteral&#39; &amp;&amp; right.type === &#39;NumericLiteral&#39;) {&#10;    return {&#10;      type: &#39;NumericLiteral&#39;,&#10;      value: evaluate(node.operator, left.value, right.value),&#10;      loc: node.loc,&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return { ...node, left, right };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> constantFold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Expression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Expression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BinaryExpression'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> constantFold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.left);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> constantFold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NumericLiteral'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NumericLiteral'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NumericLiteral'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      value: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.operator, left.value, right.value),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      loc: node.loc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node, left, right };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面的常量折叠示例展示了不可变变换的典型模式。递归处理子节点，如果可以求值就返回新的字面量节点，否则返回包含新子节点的新父节点。</p>\n<p>Rust 编译器（rustc）的 AST 变换大量使用这种模式。函数式语言编译器（如 GHC）天然适合不可变 AST，因为不可变数据结构是语言的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实际-ast-设计案例\">实际 AST 设计案例</h2><p>不同编译器的 AST 设计反映了各自的设计哲学：</p>\n<p><strong>Babel AST</strong>（ESTree 风格）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>节点类型丰富（70+ 种）</li>\n<li>每个节点包含完整的位置信息</li>\n<li>松散类型（JavaScript 对象）</li>\n<li>优化可读性和易修改性</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rust 编译器 AST</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>强类型（Rust enum 建模联合类型）</li>\n<li>使用 NodeId 和 Span 标识</li>\n<li>AST → HIR → MIR 多层降低</li>\n<li>每层 IR 删除更多语法糖</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>TypeScript AST</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有节点继承 <code>Node</code> 基类</li>\n<li>使用 <code>SyntaxKind</code> 枚举区分类型</li>\n<li>保留完整的 trivia（空白和注释）</li>\n<li>支持增量解析</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编译器</th>\n<th>AST 风格</th>\n<th>关键特点</th>\n<th>降低策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Babel</td>\n<td>ESTree 松散类型</td>\n<td>易修改，插件友好</td>\n<td>AST → AST（同层转换）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rustc</td>\n<td>强类型 enum</td>\n<td>类型安全，性能好</td>\n<td>AST → HIR → MIR → LLVM IR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>类继承</td>\n<td>保留 trivia，增量</td>\n<td>AST → Binder → Checker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>强类型接口</td>\n<td>简洁，节点类型少</td>\n<td>AST → SSA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Clang</td>\n<td>C++ 类层次</td>\n<td>丰富的元数据</td>\n<td>AST → LLVM IR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((AST 设计))&#10;    节点类型&#10;      表达式 vs 语句&#10;      联合类型/枚举&#10;      位置信息&#10;    遍历模式&#10;      访问者模式&#10;      前序/后序&#10;    变换策略&#10;      就地修改&#10;      不可变变换&#10;    实际案例&#10;      ESTree/Babel&#10;      rustc HIR/MIR&#10;      TypeScript\">mindmap\n  root((AST 设计))\n    节点类型\n      表达式 vs 语句\n      联合类型/枚举\n      位置信息\n    遍历模式\n      访问者模式\n      前序/后序\n    变换策略\n      就地修改\n      不可变变换\n    实际案例\n      ESTree/Babel\n      rustc HIR/MIR\n      TypeScript</pre><ul>\n<li>AST 是源码的语义骨架，省略了标点等语法噪音</li>\n<li>节点类型使用联合类型（Tagged Union）设计，便于类型安全的模式匹配</li>\n<li>位置信息对错误报告和 IDE 功能至关重要</li>\n<li>访问者模式是 AST 遍历和变换的标准设计模式</li>\n<li>不可变变换比就地修改更安全，适合多阶段编译流水线</li>\n<li>工业级编译器通常有多层 AST/IR（如 rustc 的 AST → HIR → MIR）</li>\n<li>AST 设计需要在表达力、性能和易用性之间找到平衡</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抽象语法树设计","id":"抽象语法树设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AST 节点类型设计","id":"ast-节点类型设计"},{"level":2,"text":"位置信息与源码映射","id":"位置信息与源码映射"},{"level":2,"text":"访问者模式与 AST 遍历","id":"访问者模式与-ast-遍历"},{"level":2,"text":"AST 变换与不可变性","id":"ast-变换与不可变性"},{"level":2,"text":"实际 AST 设计案例","id":"实际-ast-设计案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"解析器生成器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing/parser-generators"},"next":{"title":"类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/semantic-analysis/type-systems"}}